# GitHub actions that install.sh keeps as pull mirrors in Gitea (ADR-171).
# act_runner resolves every short action name (`owner/name@ref`) against these
# mirrors, so an action used by a workflow must be listed here. A workflow can
# still name any other action by its full URL, e.g.
#   uses: https://github.com/docker/login-action@<sha>
# A short name that is not listed fails the job (act_runner has no per-action
# fallback to github.com): add it here and re-run install.sh, or set
# INITPAD_CI_ACTIONS_MIRRORS=off in deploy/.env to use github.com for all.
# One `owner/name` per line. The templates use actions/checkout; the others
# are listed because developers and imported repositories commonly use them.
actions/checkout
actions/setup-node
actions/setup-python
actions/setup-java
actions/setup-go
actions/cache
docker/login-action
docker/setup-buildx-action
docker/build-push-action
docker/metadata-action
